{"id":"wb-3-142","name":"闸口白塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"闸口白塔","text":"闸口白塔，位于中国浙江省杭州市的钱塘江畔白塔公园内，是一座仿木结构的八角楼阁式石塔。该塔的建造年代不明，可根据其建筑风格和文献推断其大致建造时间为五代至北宋年间。因其特殊的地理位置，该塔曾被当做京杭大运河汇入钱塘江的地标。该塔曾位于一座名为白塔寺的寺庙之内，但寺庙已无存。该塔通高14米，共有9层塔身，每层塔身均有造像或经文雕刻，但由于年久失修，每层均有不同程度的风化和塌毁。1988年，闸口白塔被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%97%B8%E5%8F%A3%E7%99%BD%E5%A1%94","revisionId":94093075,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94093075","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/98a1e0876fd7427e95427fb1.jpg","title":"20260802_Zhakou_White_Pagoda_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260802_Zhakou_White_Pagoda_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/20260802_Zhakou_White_Pagoda_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​杭州闸口白塔","width":320,"height":480}}